2. BENCHMARK DATASETS (CC BY-NC 4.0)
   Applies to all curated dataset items, reading comprehension passages,
   question-answer pairs, and parallel translation corpora (including
   `mcq/data/`, `context_qa/data/`, `translation/`, and `results/`).

